      "type": "chapter_completed",
      "chapter_id": "first_charms_lesson"
    }
  ],
  "completion_text": {
    "zh": "<b>【一段故事留下了痕迹】</b><br>你处理这本书的方式已经被记住。校园仍然开放；下次遇到罗温或教授，他们会记得你的选择。",
    "en": "<b>[A STORY LEFT ITS MARK]</b><br>The way you treated the book is remembered. The campus remains open; Rowan or the professor will remember your choice."
  },
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "great_hall",
      "title": {
        "zh": "礼堂 · 传闻",
        "en": "Great Hall · A Rumour"
      },
      "narration": {
        "zh": "餐盘碰撞的声音里，罗温正给几个同学讲一册会自己翻页的旧书。你可以听，也可以先去别处看看。",
        "en": "Over the clatter of plates, Rowan tells students about an old book that turns its own pages. You may listen, or explore elsewhere first."
      },
      "revisit_narration": {
        "zh": "礼堂仍旧热闹，罗温朝你点头，像是等你说出自己的发现。",
        "en": "The hall is still lively. Rowan nods, as if waiting to hear what you found."
      },
      "actors": [
        "rowan_vale"
      ],
      "arrival_lines": [
        {
          "type": "npc_dialogue",
          "actor_id": "rowan_vale",
          "speaker": {
            "zh": "罗温·维尔",
            "en": "Rowan Vale"
          },
          "text": {
            "zh": "“你还记得车上的糖果吗？那本书也像在找人说话。”",
            "en": "“Remember the sweets on the train? That book seems to be looking for someone to talk to.”"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "npc_remembers",
              "npc_id": "rowan_vale",
              "key": "shared_quiet_journey"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "ask_rowan_about_book",
          "label": {
            "zh": "问罗温：谁在翻页？",
            "en": "Ask Rowan who turns the pages"
          },
          "player_text": {
            "zh": "你问罗温，那本书究竟想让人看见什么。",
            "en": "You ask Rowan what the book is trying to show."
          },
          "aliases": [
            "问罗温",
            "和罗温说话",
            "ask Rowan"
          ],
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "missing_flag",
              "key": "rowan_hint"
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "key": "rowan_hint"
            }
          ],
          "response_lines": [
            {
              "type": "npc_dialogue",
              "actor_id": "rowan_vale",
              "speaker": {
                "zh": "罗温·维尔",
                "en": "Rowan Vale"
              },
              "text": {
                "zh": "“我只看到一行：‘请不要把我忘在喷泉旁。’也许它在寻找写下这句话的人。”",
                "en": "“I saw one line: ‘Please don't leave me by the fountain.’ Maybe it's searching for whoever wrote it.”"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hall_to_library",
          "label": {
