              "type": "narration",
              "text": {
                "zh": "你选择让这段被遗忘的善意重新被人听见。罗温认真记下艾琳的名字。",
                "en": "You let a forgotten kindness be heard again. Rowan carefully writes down Erin's name."
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "npc_dialogue",
              "actor_id": "rowan_vale",
              "speaker": {"zh": "罗温·维尔", "en": "Rowan Vale"},
              "text": {"zh": "“我会记住艾琳，也会记住是你选择讲出这件事。”", "en": "“I will remember Erin, and that you chose to tell her story.”"}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
