              "speaker": {
                "zh": "图书管理员米拉",
                "en": "Librarian Mira"
              },
              "text": {
                "zh": "“有时，能理解一个故事，并不意味着我们有权替它的主人公开。”",
                "en": "“Understanding a story does not always give us the right to publish it for its owner.”"
              }
            }
