            "zh": "弗立维教授",
            "en": "Professor Flitwick"
          },
          "text": {
            "zh": "“有些魔法的用处，是帮我们更轻地触碰旧事。”",
            "en": "“Some magic helps us touch old things more gently.”"
          }
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
